    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/48b1d1ba9ad74e55a1d144fad42956b8"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/80b3f8ed46dd4024bebbf2e68c60c828"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/b729e28d93a44cd4a713a8a2de208117"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/824ad841f4414dab8c1f32b19989b046"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/48b1d1ba9ad74e55a1d144fad42956b8","stringItemText":"Soil Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/80b3f8ed46dd4024bebbf2e68c60c828","stringItemText":"Asphalt Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/b729e28d93a44cd4a713a8a2de208117","stringItemText":"Concrete Integrity Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/824ad841f4414dab8c1f32b19989b046","stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/a8f1838b9559432b94c2c25b055c23bf","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/a8f1838b9559432b94c2c25b055c23bf","content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe Roadlab Mossel Bay team is currently helping reconstruct and widen of a major bridge near George.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/x4phvx4j/4.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Roadlab team in Mossel Bay is contributing to the reconstruction and widening of a three span arch bridge on the R102 in George.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe existing road structure and pavement layers are being widened to include a shoulder on each lane, requiring the reconstruction of the approaching pavement layers, road structure and road surface.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur team will be conducting all soil, concrete and asphalt acceptance control testing on behalf of SNA Civil \u0026amp; Structural Engineers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce our work is done, the newly constructed bridge will have a dual carriage way with 3.2m lane width and 2.0m shoulder on each side, reducing the high accident risk owing to the narrow lane width crossing the bridge.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/orylbih0/whatsapp-image-2021-06-15-at-15-48-52.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/4pdfrqhi/1.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/z4nfsjve/3.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/syipu5fc/5.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoil testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCompaction and densities\u003cbr /\u003eMaterial classification\u003cbr /\u003eGeotechnical investigation\u003cbr /\u003eTest pit investigation and analysis\u003cbr /\u003eDynamic cone penetration\u003cbr /\u003eStabilization mix designs\u003cbr /\u003eMaterial analysis\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/hhgjtak4/whatsapp-image-2021-06-15-at-15-48-53.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/43omwc2t/2.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dgjbtly2/whatsapp-image-2021-06-15-at-15-48-51.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/0dwknbjc/whatsapp-image-2021-06-15-at-15-48-52-1.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConcrete testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCompressive strength\u003cbr /\u003eDurability of concrete\u003cbr /\u003eConcrete mix design analysis\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAsphalt testing\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eAsphalt mix design analysis\u003cbr /\u003eAsphalt, Marshall testing/analysis\u003cbr /\u003eCore drilling and compaction analysis\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need confidence in your work site or construction materials, reach out to us below.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of South Africa’s state enterprises, over 400 construction companies and more than 60 consulting firms.</p>]]></Value>
